ps://www.discogs.com/search/?q=Touch+%26+SMOKAHOLIC+RADI&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": ["2025 BLTNM Records LTD"]}], "counts": {"high": 0, "mid": 21, "low": 8}, "transcripts": [{"start": "00:15:41", "end": "00:16:29", "text": "Held by strangers who didn't need to remember my name to see past all my hurt, guilt, and shame. I found pieces of myself scattered across dark rooms and quiet streets where the sunrise meets. The edge of night held us bare. We were black trans and she was femme with Palestinian flags in her hair. I wrote this song in bed, feverish and dreaming. This city I'm in had me once again believing I'm good enough now as I ever have been."}, {"start": "01:28:35", "end": "01:28:59", "text": "A décalé Conakry, a décalé Choco, a décalé Choco, a décalé Abidjan, a décalé Wala, Wala, c'est fini, le pistolero."}, {"start": "03:25:49", "end": "03:26:06", "text": "Spend all my time looking online for things to buy. My time looking online."}, {"start": "03:47:46", "end": "03:48:08", "text": "We'll see you next time on FBi Radio 94.5 Sydney with the M.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O"}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:00:00"}, "track": {"title": "Kamikazi", "artists": [{"name": "D'Angelo & Slingbaum"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:08:00"}, "track": {"title": "horseshoe", "artists": [{"name": "Hooky & Winter"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:19:19"}, "track": {"title": "Music", "artists": [{"name": "underscores"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:22:46"}, "track": {"title": "Ngamaka (feat. Leroy Johnson)", "artists": [{"name": "BARKAA"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:45:00"}, "track": {"title": "Around the World La La L